  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "page-1",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "intro",
          "fieldType": "html",
          "htmlContent": "\u003ch2 style=\u0027margin:0 0 8px\u0027\u003eExpression Functions Test Suite\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDemonstrates the built-in expression engine functions: \u003cstrong\u003edate arithmetic\u003c/strong\u003e (\u003ccode\u003eaddDays\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003esubDays\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003ediffDays\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003etoday\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003eyear\u003c/code\u003e), \u003cstrong\u003enumeric helpers\u003c/strong\u003e (\u003ccode\u003emin\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003emax\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003eround\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003efloor\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003eceil\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003eabs\u003c/code\u003e), and \u003cstrong\u003econditional\u003c/strong\u003e (\u003ccode\u003eif\u003c/code\u003e). Fill in the input fields and watch the results update live.\u003c/p\u003e",
          "iframeHeight": 110
        },
        {
          "id": "section-date",
          "fieldType": "section",
          "title": "1 â€” Date Arithmetic",
          "fields": [
            {
              "id": "start-date",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "question": "Start Date",
              "inputType": "date",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "id": "end-date",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "question": "End Date",
              "inputType": "date",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "id": "date-results",
              "fieldType": "display",
              "content": "**14 days after start:** \u003caddDays({start-date}, 14)\u003e\n\n**7 days before start:** \u003csubDays({start-date}, 7)\u003e\n\n**Days between start â†’ end:** \u003cdiffDays({end-date}, {start-date})\u003e\n\n**Year of start date:** \u003cyear({start-date})\u003e\n\n**Today:** \u003ctoday()\u003e",
              "rules": [
                {
                  "effect": "visible",
                  "logic": "AND",
                  "conditions": [
                    {
                      "conditionType": "expression",
                      "expression": "{start-date} !== \u0027\u0027 \u0026\u0026 {end-date} !== \u0027\u0027"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "date-gap-warning",
              "fieldType": "display",
              "content": "âš ï¸ End date is more than 30 days after start.",
              "rules": [
                {
                  "effect": "visible",
                  "logic": "AND",
                  "conditions": [
                    {
                      "conditionType": "expression",
                      "expression": "{start-date} !== \u0027\u0027 \u0026\u0026 {end-date} !== \u0027\u0027 \u0026\u0026 diffDays({end-date}, {start-date}) \u003e 30"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "date-order-warning",
              "fieldType": "display",
              "content": "âš ï¸ End date is before start date.",
              "rules": [
                {
                  "effect": "visible",
                  "logic": "AND",
                  "conditions": [
                    {
                      "conditionType": "expression",
                      "expression": "{start-date} !== \u0027\u0027 \u0026\u0026 {end-date} !== \u0027\u0027 \u0026\u0026 diffDays({end-date}, {start-date}) \u003c 0"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
