              "content": "**BMI:** \u003cround({weight-kg} / (({height-cm} / 100) * ({height-cm} / 100)))\u003e\n\n**Category:** \u003cif(round({weight-kg} / (({height-cm} / 100) * ({height-cm} / 100))) \u003e= 30, \u0027Obese\u0027, if(round({weight-kg} / (({height-cm} / 100) * ({height-cm} / 100))) \u003e= 25, \u0027Overweight\u0027, if(round({weight-kg} / (({height-cm} / 100) * ({height-cm} / 100))) \u003e= 18.5, \u0027Normal weight\u0027, \u0027Underweight\u0027)))\u003e",
              "rules": [
